      "original": "On 26 October 2026, an outbreak of H5N1 was confirmed on farm for laying hens in Lutjegast, a 3 km protection zone and a 10 km surveillance zone have been established. In the 3 km zone there are no other poultry premises. The subtype HPAI H5N1 is confirmed by the national reference laboratory (NRL). All susceptible animals on the infected premises have been killed.",
